DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nKeynote & Dialogue with Singapore Minister for Manpow
	er and Second Minister for Trade & Industry\, Dr Tan See Leng\nSpeaker\n:\
	nDr TAN See Leng\nSingapore Minister for Manpower and Second Minister for 
	Trade & Industry\nModerator\n:\nKwee Juan HAN\nJoining Instructions\n(via 
	Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\
	, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https:/
	/dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlC
	q6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. Th
	is will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal str
	eaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: 
	Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeba38
	e206605d89de4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Add
	ress and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download We
	bex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join M
	eeting & Input Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n 
	\nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +8
	52-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +
	91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlobal 
	call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e67686736
	2e0173666ba5856cc26881d5> \n \n \n \n \n
